            "review_text": "moniquecover\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam192 contributions\n0\nBirthday dinner\nMar 2026 • Friends\nWe visited Lupin for a birthday dinner for four people. When we arrived just before 7 pm, it was fairly empty, but it rapidly filled up. Definitely recommend making a reservation. We ordered two bottles of wine, both delicious. Appetizers were the foie gras and bone marrow with escargot; both dishes were well made. All of us ordered steak. The servers brought out a dessert for my friend’s birthday, which was a sweet gesture. Great ambiance and good service. We would definitely return.\nRead more\nWritten March 21, 2026",
